WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Hey, H2H families. Eriana here.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
At the end of this month, Sunday, November 1st, the
clocks fall back an hour.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.750
So you might be hearing a lot about getting an extra
hour of sleep,

4
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.612
but we all know that if you have little kids, kids
don't read clocks,

5
00:00:13.612 --> 00:00:17.754
so they'll just wake up at their usual time, which
is now an hour earlier.

6
00:00:17.754 --> 00:00:21.000
So for many parents, you don't get that extra hour
at all.

7
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.935
Children's hospital sleep experts have a couple
suggestions that might help.

8
00:00:25.935 --> 00:00:31.000
One is moving bedtime a little at a time in the days
before the actual change.

9
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.889
Another is making sure that your routine remains
steady.

10
00:00:34.889 --> 00:00:39.056
So meals, bath, books, even if the clock feels a
little off.

11
00:00:39.056 --> 00:00:44.750
We know that that first week might be rough, but
most kids adjust in about a week.

12
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:46.000
So, hang in there.

13
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.000
We also put a few trusted links below with more
tips.

14
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.827
Next month, we'll ask what are some ways that you
would like to connect with other H2H families.

15
00:00:53.827 --> 00:00:58.000
As you go through October, think about what kind of
connection would actually help.

16
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.000
You can drop your ideas in the feedback box on this
page at any time.

17
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Thank you so much for being here with us, and see
you next month!

